      "number": 885,
      "title": "docs: state when migration namespaces are chosen",
      "body": "Clarify the implemented contract: a migration takes the package major.minor active when it is authored; patch releases append there, and migrations authored after a minor bump begin the next namespace. This keeps the docs aligned with new_migration.py and the release gate.\\n\\nValidation: cargo fmt --check; migration check.",
