    {
      "number": 932,
      "title": "mac: preserve Wave detail across refresh failures",
      "body": "## Summary\n\n- decode `lf status` directly into the complete `WaveDetailSnapshot`\n- keep the last successful selected-Wave detail visible when a refresh fails\n- use one cancellation-aware refresh task so stale work cannot replace a newer reading\n\n## Verification\n\n- `swift test --package-path swift` — 110 tests passed\n- full repository gate recorded in `scratch/qa-findings.md`",
